config MTK_VCODEC_COMPAT
	tristate "MediaTek MT6765 /dev/Vcodec for the stock video codec blobs"
	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on MTK_ION_COMPAT
	depends on MFD_SYSCON
	help
	  Provides /dev/Vcodec with the ioctl ABI of the MT6765 Linux 4.19
	  vendor kernel's video codec driver, for the stock MediaTek codec
	  libraries (libvcodecdrv and the codec2 components built on it).
	  Those libraries program the H.264 encoder and the H.264/HEVC
	  decoder themselves; this driver arbitrates, powers and routes the
	  shared codec core, delivers its interrupts and gives the libraries
	  M4U addresses for their buffers through the ION compatibility
	  device.

	  If unsure, say N.
